{
    "title": "Omio: Train and bus travel app",
    "description": "<b>Compare & Book Your Next Train, Bus, Flight, or Ferry Ticket Across Europe, the US and Beyond! </b>\ud83d\ude84\ud83d\ude8c\u2708\ufe0f\u26f4\ufe0f\r\n\r\nOmio makes planning your next trip easy. Compare and book train, ferry, flight, and bus tickets \u2014 all in one place! \r\nWhether you're planning to travel by train with Amtrak, booking a bus trip with FlixBus, flying with American Airlines, or taking a ferry with P&O Ferries, Omio makes travel easy. With access to over 37 countries and more than 1,000 trusted transport providers, booking tickets for your next trip has never been simpler! \u200b\u200b\r\n\r\n<b>Why Choose Omio?</b>\r\n\r\n<b>All-in-One Travel</b>: Book tickets for trains, buses, flights, or ferries and compare prices across top providers in Europe, the US and the UK's largest names like Greyhound, Deutsche Bahn, \u00d6BB, SNCF, and SWR.\r\n<b>Easy to Use</b>: Discover the best routes and book tickets effortlessly. Pay securely using Google Pay, PayPal, SOFORT, Alipay, or credit card in  USD, GBP or Euros, and receive mobile tickets directly on your phone. \r\n<b>Omio Flex</b>: Change or cancel your plans easily with our flexible ticket options.\r\n<b>Exclusive Discounts on Tickets</b>: Students, frequent travellers, and more can enjoy discounts on tickets through special offers, referral programs, and loyalty cards.\r\n<b>Live Updates</b>: Get real-time updates for train times, bus times, and more. Track your train status for US travels, Trenitalia, Renfe, SNCF, Deutsche Bahn, Italo Treno, NEX & more.\r\n<b>Mobile Tickets</b>: Save time by adding your train, bus, flight and ferry tickets directly to the app. Skip the lines and get your ticket ready whenever you need it.\r\n<b>Support at the Palm of Your Hand</b>: Omio provides 24/7 international customer service, ensuring you\u2019re always covered, no matter where you are.\r\n\r\n<b>Travel with the best train providers</b> \ud83d\ude84:\r\n\r\nBook train tickets with trusted providers across Europe and North America, including National Rail, Eurostar, SBB, SNCF, Trenitalia, Deutsche Bahn (DB), Renfe, Renfe Avlo, Italo NTV, and Iryo.\r\nTravel in the UK by train with Greater Anglia, GWR (Great Western Railway), LNER, ScotRail, Northern Rail, Thameslink, SWR (South Western Railway), East Midlands Trains, Southern Railway, West Midlands Railway, Arriva Trains Wales, and CrossCountry, alongside Caledonian Sleeper, Heathrow Express and Gatwick Express. \r\nTravel across borders with NS International, SNCB, and \u00d6BB, or choose high-speed trains with OUIGO, VR Finland, SJ Sweden and Comboios de Portugal. \r\nPlan your trips in North America by train with Amtrak or Via Rail.\r\n\r\n<b>Book bus tickets effortlessly</b> \ud83d\ude8c:\r\n\r\nTravel with major bus operators \u2014 National Express and FlixBus, as well as Eurolines, ALSA, Blablacar bus, RegioJet, Vy Buss, Sociobus, PKS Polonus, Avanza Bus, Movelia, Rede Expressos, Infobus, MarinoBus, Itabus, IberoCoach, and Daibus.\r\nEmbark on North American bus trips with OurBus, Go Buses, and RedCoach.\r\n \r\n<b>Flight tickets in a few taps</b> \u2708\ufe0f:\r\n\r\nDiscover flights with leading airlines such as Ryanair, EasyJet, British Airways, Wizz Air, Aer Lingus, Vueling, Eurowings, SmartWings, Lufthansa, American Airlines, United and Loganair.\r\n\r\n<b>Sail smoothly on ferries </b>\u26f4\ufe0f:\r\n\r\nBook ferry tickets with reliable operators like Balearia, Blue Star Ferries, Fast Ferries, GNV, Golden Star Ferries, Mobylines, NLG, Positano Jet, Seajets, Snav, Stena Line, and Travelmar, providing connections across Europe, and the UK.\r\n\r\nWith an impressive 4.7/5 rating on Trustpilot from over 1,500 reviews, Omio is the go-to platform for travellers looking for a reliable travel experience to plan your trip and book tickets. \r\nIf Omio has made your travels smoother, take a moment to leave a review!\r\nContact\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to us at help.omio.com/hc/en-us\r\nStay Connected\r\nFollow Omio for the latest travel updates, tips, and exclusive offers:\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Omio\r\nInstagram: https://instagram.com/Omio/\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@omioglobal",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Compare &amp; Book Your Next Train, Bus, Flight, or Ferry Ticket Across Europe, the US and Beyond! </b>\ud83d\ude84\ud83d\ude8c\u2708\ufe0f\u26f4\ufe0f<br><br>Omio makes planning your next trip easy. Compare and book train, ferry, flight, and bus tickets \u2014 all in one place! <br>Whether you&#39;re planning to travel by train with Amtrak, booking a bus trip with FlixBus, flying with American Airlines, or taking a ferry with P&amp;O Ferries, Omio makes travel easy. With access to over 37 countries and more than 1,000 trusted transport providers, booking tickets for your next trip has never been simpler! \u200b\u200b<br><br><b>Why Choose Omio?</b><br><br><b>All-in-One Travel</b>: Book tickets for trains, buses, flights, or ferries and compare prices across top providers in Europe, the US and the UK&#39;s largest names like Greyhound, Deutsche Bahn, \u00d6BB, SNCF, and SWR.<br><b>Easy to Use</b>: Discover the best routes and book tickets effortlessly. Pay securely using Google Pay, PayPal, SOFORT, Alipay, or credit card in  USD, GBP or Euros, and receive mobile tickets directly on your phone. <br><b>Omio Flex</b>: Change or cancel your plans easily with our flexible ticket options.<br><b>Exclusive Discounts on Tickets</b>: Students, frequent travellers, and more can enjoy discounts on tickets through special offers, referral programs, and loyalty cards.<br><b>Live Updates</b>: Get real-time updates for train times, bus times, and more. Track your train status for US travels, Trenitalia, Renfe, SNCF, Deutsche Bahn, Italo Treno, NEX &amp; more.<br><b>Mobile Tickets</b>: Save time by adding your train, bus, flight and ferry tickets directly to the app. Skip the lines and get your ticket ready whenever you need it.<br><b>Support at the Palm of Your Hand</b>: Omio provides 24/7 international customer service, ensuring you\u2019re always covered, no matter where you are.<br><br><b>Travel with the best train providers</b> \ud83d\ude84:<br><br>Book train tickets with trusted providers across Europe and North America, including National Rail, Eurostar, SBB, SNCF, Trenitalia, Deutsche Bahn (DB), Renfe, Renfe Avlo, Italo NTV, and Iryo.<br>Travel in the UK by train with Greater Anglia, GWR (Great Western Railway), LNER, ScotRail, Northern Rail, Thameslink, SWR (South Western Railway), East Midlands Trains, Southern Railway, West Midlands Railway, Arriva Trains Wales, and CrossCountry, alongside Caledonian Sleeper, Heathrow Express and Gatwick Express. <br>Travel across borders with NS International, SNCB, and \u00d6BB, or choose high-speed trains with OUIGO, VR Finland, SJ Sweden and Comboios de Portugal. <br>Plan your trips in North America by train with Amtrak or Via Rail.<br><br><b>Book bus tickets effortlessly</b> \ud83d\ude8c:<br><br>Travel with major bus operators \u2014 National Express and FlixBus, as well as Eurolines, ALSA, Blablacar bus, RegioJet, Vy Buss, Sociobus, PKS Polonus, Avanza Bus, Movelia, Rede Expressos, Infobus, MarinoBus, Itabus, IberoCoach, and Daibus.<br>Embark on North American bus trips with OurBus, Go Buses, and RedCoach.<br> <br><b>Flight tickets in a few taps</b> \u2708\ufe0f:<br><br>Discover flights with leading airlines such as Ryanair, EasyJet, British Airways, Wizz Air, Aer Lingus, Vueling, Eurowings, SmartWings, Lufthansa, American Airlines, United and Loganair.<br><br><b>Sail smoothly on ferries </b>\u26f4\ufe0f:<br><br>Book ferry tickets with reliable operators like Balearia, Blue Star Ferries, Fast Ferries, GNV, Golden Star Ferries, Mobylines, NLG, Positano Jet, Seajets, Snav, Stena Line, and Travelmar, providing connections across Europe, and the UK.<br><br>With an impressive 4.7/5 rating on Trustpilot from over 1,500 reviews, Omio is the go-to platform for travellers looking for a reliable travel experience to plan your trip and book tickets. <br>If Omio has made your travels smoother, take a moment to leave a review!<br>Contact<br>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to us at help.omio.com/hc/en-us<br>Stay Connected<br>Follow Omio for the latest travel updates, tips, and exclusive offers:<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Omio<br>Instagram: https://instagram.com/Omio/<br>TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@omioglobal",
